{
    "title": "Realm: Create your best home",
    "description": "Realm was named one of TIME magazine\u2019s Best Inventions of 2021 and has helped 50,000+ homeowners plan renovation projects, track their home value, and make more informed decisions about their homes. \r\n\r\nYou\u2019ve got renovation goals. Realm has the experts and data to help you achieve them. The free Realm app helps you avoid getting ripped off with fair renovation estimates customized to your home. You can also connect with hand-picked, vetted contractors without getting spammed with calls or emails. Neighborhood renovation trends show you what projects your neighbors have done and how much they cost, so you don\u2019t overpay for the same work. Plus, you can discover how much your home is really worth with the best home value tracker available. Get the free Realm app to save time, money, and stress on your next home renovation.\r\n\r\nRenovate without regrets. Download the free Realm app to get:\r\n\r\nRENOVATION PLANNING\r\n- Plan and customize 40+ renovation projects \r\n- Get renovation pricing specific to your location & design choices\r\n- Find vetted contractors who are available and do quality work\r\n- Prioritize renovations based on your budget and financial goals\r\n- Discover which renovations will add the most value to your home\r\n\r\nNEIGHBORHOOD TRENDS\r\n- Find out which renovations are popular in your local real estate market  \r\n- Get updates about neighbors who have renovated and find out how much they spent\r\n- Stay on top of recent home sales & price trends in your neighborhood\r\n- Make smart decisions about when to sell or stay put based on local market conditions\r\n\r\nHOME VALUE UPDATES\r\n- Get instant updates when your home value changes \r\n- See your home value rank compared to your neighbors \r\n- Find out how much comparable homes sell for in your local real estate market\r\n- Get alerts about home equity changes and milestones \r\n\r\nHave questions or feedback? Email us at learn@realmhome.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Realm was named one of TIME magazine\u2019s Best Inventions of 2021 and has helped 50,000+ homeowners plan renovation projects, track their home value, and make more informed decisions about their homes. <br><br>You\u2019ve got renovation goals. Realm has the experts and data to help you achieve them. The free Realm app helps you avoid getting ripped off with fair renovation estimates customized to your home. You can also connect with hand-picked, vetted contractors without getting spammed with calls or emails. Neighborhood renovation trends show you what projects your neighbors have done and how much they cost, so you don\u2019t overpay for the same work. Plus, you can discover how much your home is really worth with the best home value tracker available. Get the free Realm app to save time, money, and stress on your next home renovation.<br><br>Renovate without regrets. Download the free Realm app to get:<br><br>RENOVATION PLANNING<br>- Plan and customize 40+ renovation projects <br>- Get renovation pricing specific to your location &amp; design choices<br>- Find vetted contractors who are available and do quality work<br>- Prioritize renovations based on your budget and financial goals<br>- Discover which renovations will add the most value to your home<br><br>NEIGHBORHOOD TRENDS<br>- Find out which renovations are popular in your local real estate market  <br>- Get updates about neighbors who have renovated and find out how much they spent<br>- Stay on top of recent home sales &amp; price trends in your neighborhood<br>- Make smart decisions about when to sell or stay put based on local market conditions<br><br>HOME VALUE UPDATES<br>- Get instant updates when your home value changes <br>- See your home value rank compared to your neighbors <br>- Find out how much comparable homes sell for in your local real estate market<br>- Get alerts about home equity changes and milestones <br><br>Have questions or feedback? Email us at learn@realmhom